STATIC (no clock)
-----------------
plain vs rect: __text 1,837,492 -> 1,851,192 (+13,700); 2 symbols resized
  (LfBlock::open, +8 B at 8bpc and +212 B at 16bpc); every other hot 8bpc
  loop-filter symbol is a BYTE-IDENTICAL instruction stream.
llvm-lines: +2,546 IR lines (+0.51%), 18 functions changed; 2,061 of the new
  lines are fill_rect's TWELVE monomorphisations, ~12,000 of the 13,700 bytes.
plain2 vs ship: the ONLY 12 symbols that change size are the 12 cold
  fill_threaded monomorphisations; both LfBlock::open are byte-identical.
DEFAULT build vs base commit: __text identical, 0 resized, 0 added.

